# Tailwind

- Use Tailwind utilities in Vue templates.
- Keep the Tailwind v4 import in `src/style.css`.
- Prefer semantic HTML, responsive utilities, and visible focus states.
- Use class bindings for conditional styles; avoid manually building class strings.
- Extract shared UI only after real reuse appears.
